Happy Kubernetes interaction!</code></pre>
    <h5 class="card-title">One-time code (fallback).</h5>
    <p class="card-text text-body-secondary small">If kubeconfig is not delivered automatically after login, KubeDash shows a one-time code. Example (use the real code from the KubeDash page; this line uses a sample token only):</p>
    <pre><code class="bash">$ kubectl kdlogin --code ${exchange_code} --base-url ${base_uri}/</code></pre>
    <p class="card-text text-body-secondary small mb-0">Use <code>--port</code> if the local kdlogin listener uses a port other than 8080.</p>
